    {
      "id": "claim_1a6f048f95174a0489b01cf9b2ced342",
      "statement": "`CHECKOUT_AUTH_BYPASS` is a debug-only relaxation: the backend only enables it when the flag parses true and `GIN_MODE` equals `debug`, and bootstrap then applies that setting to the order handler via `WithDevelopmentAuthBypass()`.",
