      "id": "claim_119589c9f7294095a7f7d7da9c5cde58",
      "statement": "`bootstrap.Migrate()` currently runs schema migrations for users, identity, orders, decision memory, accessory catalog, resume session, and promotions, while `bootstrap.Seed()` only seeds startup metadata through `database.EnsureStartupKey(...)` rather than loading demo products.",
