    {
      "id": "claim_6ea79ae77d434f93a41a571d1e9ea239",
      "statement": "The backend HTTP server bootstraps database, Redis, an async job client, file storage, identity, users, orders, catalog, accessories, promotions, decision-memory sessions, resume sessions, and the `/health` route in one process through `bootstrap.Run()`.",
