      "id": "claim_94e48289ccfa43ecbfcbe980c05e9486",
      "statement": "The worker is a separate Go process that connects to the same Redis and Postgres services, runs both an Asynq queue server and an Asynq scheduler, handles order-confirmation jobs, and registers a recurring price-check job every 30 minutes.",
